physicalRef: telecom_msisdn_indicators
description: "Telecom Link Analysis showcase - one row per home-network MSISDN with a transparent 0-100 indicator_score, its seven factor columns and the typology columns (fan-out, inbound, average duration, out/in ratio, premium share, IMEI sharing, activation). Built by the telecom_msisdn_indicators Job; formula in docs/superpower/la-telecom-demo-data.md. Synthetic."
